,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达与思科联合发布USFP光模块规范，实现单通道400G传输</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软发布第三代自研AI芯片Maia300，计划2027年正式投产</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta发布旗舰AI模型Muse Wonder与Wonder Full对标OpenAI与Anthropic</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里千问推出Personal Agent「千问Go」，实现办事类Agent落地真实App</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/768eacce6fe1cc0c56566dacbb9f5c5d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里千问正式推出Personal Agent「千问Go」，通过Agent架构升级，将办事范围从短链路扩展至无固定流程的复杂事务。首批落地场景涵盖机票延误理赔、电商价保、汽车保养预约及运动场地预订等。在机票理赔案例中，千问Go可自主在云端登录平台、排查订单、与客服多轮交涉并完成现金赔付；在淘宝价保场景下，Agent能自动遍历订单并识别降价商品申请退差。该产品核心在于具备根据执行结果动态切换入口、平台与沟通方式的“换路能力”，且支持在用户关闭App后于云端持续执行任务。行业分析指出，个人Agent的普及将显著扩大在线活动规模，并带动算力需求激增，预计全球CPU市场规模至2030年将达3000亿美元。阿里凭借Agent入口与交易平台的双重布局，有望进一步提升消费AI的商业转化效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英特尔陈立武预警：AI 硬件还要缺两三年，智能体正改写芯片配比</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/653006262d8058c048ab4344d0e44641.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英特尔陈立武预警：AI 硬件还要缺两三年，智能体正改写芯片配比AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Oct 13, 202615英特尔首席执行官陈立武在新加坡星展银行举办的会议上判断，受技术供应链持续受限拖累，未来两到三年人工智能硬件仍将保持供应紧张。这场 10 月 12 日的新加坡活动上，他系统梳理了 AI 与量子等核心趋势。而他抛出短缺论断时，内存芯片等核心元件正持续紧缺、价格连月攀升，台积电的封装产能也顶到天花板。作为紧盯芯片工艺与新材料的高管，陈立武对行业风向向来敏感。智能体拉动 CPU，量子三年可期 更值得玩味的是需求结构的迁移。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达与思科联合发布USFP光模块规范，实现单通道400G传输</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达与思科于10月12日联合推出业界首款支持400Gbps/lane高速信号的可插拔光模块规范USFP，旨在解决AI集群数据传输瓶颈。该规范在保持与OSFP光模块相当尺寸的前提下，通过400G SerDes技术将带宽提升至现行200G/lane模块的4倍。首批产品集成16条全双工通道，吞吐量达12.8Tb/s，并支持扩展至32条以上。在能效方面，USFP较现有方案提升1.3倍，且支持100W功耗。连接器采用新型二维阵列两步插入方案，有效减少触点磨损并保障信号完整性。对于AI集群而言，USFP通过单通道速率翻倍与总带宽四倍扩容，为大规模模型训练提供了更高效的数据互连方案，简化了交换机侧的供电与散热设计，是AI算力基础设施的关键换代技术。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软发布第三代自研AI芯片Maia300，计划2027年正式投产</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0531409f632525611b0876c643e52509.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软正式发布第三代自研AI芯片Maia300，计划于2027年投入生产，旨在成为微软产品和服务的主要AI推理系统。该芯片针对长上下文推理、低延迟对话及多步骤智能体任务进行深度优化。性能方面，微软云计算集团执行副总裁Scott Guthrie表示，Maia300每兆瓦的Token交付量较领先GPU系统提升40%，在96加速器配置下，其机架级Token吞吐量达到上一代Maia200的7倍。微软计划自2027年起将Azure Maia系列部署规模扩展至数千亿瓦级，以提升推理效率并降低基础设施成本。Maia300作为Maia200的继任者，将进一步适配新一代AI应用需求，增强微软对AI算力供应链的掌控能力，并逐步提高自研芯片在内部AI基础设施中的应用比例。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta发布旗舰AI模型Muse Wonder与Wonder Full对标OpenAI与Anthropic</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d5b256fb8d19e8a800496f952486380f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta于当地时间周一正式推出新一代旗舰AI模型Muse Wonder及高阶版Muse Wonder Full，旨在追赶Anthropic与OpenAI的技术水平。测试数据显示，两款模型在推理、写作及代码能力上已接近行业顶尖水准。该项目由首席AI官亚历山大·王（Alexandr Wang）带队研发，内部代号“西瓜”，是Meta首款明确对标前沿竞品的产品。Muse Wonder将赋能Muse应用，而Wonder Full则仅面向Muse Code高阶订阅用户开放。尽管此前曾因预训练调整导致发布推迟，但Meta正通过将模型集成至Instagram、Facebook及WhatsApp等拥有35亿用户的生态中，加速AI布局。扎克伯格强调，该架构旨在赋能用户而非制造风险，Meta正借此尝试切入由OpenAI与Anthro</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
